1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,436
Dengar aba-abaku.

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,954
Empat ratus!

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,836
Kita cuma enam puluh.

4
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:10,092
Bukan gerbang desa,

5
00:00:10,265 --> 00:00:11,535
jaga saluran.

6
00:00:11,947 --> 00:00:13,193
Empat ratus pun,

7
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:14,738
tetap lewat saluran itu.

8
00:00:14,798 --> 00:00:16,323
Misi jaga desa:

9
00:00:16,396 --> 00:00:19,819
wanita, anak, semua selamat.

10
00:00:19,908 --> 00:00:20,681
Karung kapur,

11
00:00:20,743 --> 00:00:21,897
tiap tiga langkah.

12
00:00:21,966 --> 00:00:23,802
Dangkal begini?

13
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,058
Tak perlu dalam.

14
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,153
Asal tersandung.

15
00:00:26,227 --> 00:00:27,045
Depan, jongkok!

16
00:00:27,111 --> 00:00:28,725
Tunggu aba-abaku, diam!

17
00:00:29,511 --> 00:00:30,625
Xiaotang, jaga wanita dan anak.

18
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,642
Terus kamu di mana?

19
00:00:32,708 --> 00:00:33,460
Kamu turun.

20
00:00:33,714 --> 00:00:35,320
Di sini bisa mati.

21
00:00:35,699 --> 00:00:36,614
Aku di sini,

22
00:00:36,879 --> 00:00:37,766
temani kamu.

23
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:40,831
Serbu!

24
00:00:40,934 --> 00:00:42,934
Berasnya milik kita!

25
00:00:43,002 --> 00:00:43,391
Tunggu.

26
00:00:44,202 --> 00:00:45,268
Lempar!

27
00:00:50,202 --> 00:00:50,839
Apa ini!

28
00:00:53,694 --> 00:00:55,560
Obornya padam semua!

29
00:00:59,989 --> 00:01:01,662
Kakak mana?

30
00:01:01,734 --> 00:01:02,711
Satu masuk,

31
00:01:02,898 --> 00:01:03,720
satu tumbang.

32
00:01:03,774 --> 00:01:04,316
Keluar!

33
00:01:09,374 --> 00:01:10,488
Tak satu pun masuk!

34
00:01:13,451 --> 00:01:14,746
Golok Tuan Diao Qi,

35
00:01:14,807 --> 00:01:15,996
Minggir!

36
00:01:16,074 --> 00:01:16,695
Golok,

37
00:01:16,764 --> 00:01:17,855
letakkan.

38
00:01:22,715 --> 00:01:23,591
Ikat!

39
00:01:23,656 --> 00:01:24,752
Ke lumbung!

40
00:01:24,821 --> 00:01:26,427
Kamu tak lari.

41
00:01:26,496 --> 00:01:27,715
Aku janji temani.

42
00:01:27,786 --> 00:01:30,909
Qin Shuang, poin suka empat puluh delapan.

43
00:01:30,988 --> 00:01:32,873
Misi selesai.

44
00:01:33,333 --> 00:01:34,603
Kakak!

45
00:01:36,933 --> 00:01:37,327
Xiaohe?

46
00:01:37,792 --> 00:01:38,416
Xiaohe!
